<div class="content-wrapper"><section class="content-header"><h1><?= !empty($editId)?'Revisi':'Create' ?> Invoice — SPP / Pass Pelabuhan</h1></section><section class="content"><?php if($error): ?><div class="alert alert-danger"><?= html_escape($error) ?></div><?php endif; ?><div class="box box-primary"><div class="box-body"><p>Pilih SPP yang sudah dikonfirmasi pada satu area dan Pembeli yang sama. Volume, referensi Surat Pengantar Pengiriman, tarif berlaku dan PPN dihitung otomatis. BASTB/RDT tidak wajib. Perusahaan penagihan mengikuti Pembeli pada SPP; periksa sebelum menerbitkan invoice. Pass atau alur berita acara tetap tersedia sebagai pilihan tambahan.</p><form method="post"><?php $this->load->view('pipeline/billing_token'); ?><div class="row"><?php foreach($input as $key=>$value): ?><div class="col-sm-4 form-group"><label><?= html_escape($key) ?></label><input name="<?= $key ?>" type="<?= in_array($key,array('InvoiceDate','DueDate'),true)?'date':'text' ?>" class="form-control" value="<?= html_escape($value) ?>" required maxlength="100"></div><?php endforeach; ?></div><div class="form-group"><label>Surat Pengantar Pengiriman untuk ditagihkan</label><select name="CaptureIDs[]" class="form-control" multiple><?php foreach($captures as $c): ?><option value="<?= (int)$c['CaptureID'] ?>" <?= in_array((int)$c['CaptureID'],$captureIds,true)?'selected':'' ?>><?= html_escape('#'.$c['CaptureID'].' / '.$c['DeliveryDate'].' / '.$c['Buyer'].' / LO '.$c['LONumber'].' / DO-Shipment '.$c['ShipmentNo'].' / '.number_format($c['OrderedLiters'],0,',','.').' L / Area '.$c['SpbbID']) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select><small>Hanya SPP terkonfirmasi dan belum ditagihkan yang tersedia.</small></div><div class="form-group"><label>Dokumen tambahan / alur berita acara (opsional)</label><select name="OperationIDs[]" class="form-control" multiple><?php foreach($rows as $r): ?><option value="<?= (int)$r['OperationID'] ?>" <?= in_array((int)$r['OperationID'],$ids,true)?'selected':'' ?>><?= html_escape($r['Kind'].' / '.$r['DocumentNo'].' / '.$r['CompanyName'].' / Area '.$r['SpbbID']) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></div><button class="btn btn-primary" name="action" value="preview">Hitung / Preview</button><?php if($quote): ?><hr><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table"><tr><th>Jasa</th><th>Jumlah</th><th>Satuan</th><th>Tarif</th><th>Nilai</th></tr><?php foreach($quote['lines'] as $l): ?><tr><td><?= html_escape($l['Description']) ?></td><td><?= number_format($l['Quantity'],3,',','.') ?></td><td><?= html_escape($l['Unit']) ?></td><td><?= number_format($l['Rate'],2,',','.') ?></td><td>Rp <?= number_format($l['Amount'],0,',','.') ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></table></div><p><?= html_escape($quote['CustomerName']) ?> · <?= number_format($quote['TotalLiters'],3,',','.') ?> liter · <?= number_format($quote['TotalTons'],3,',','.') ?> TON</p><h3>Total Rp <?= number_format($quote['GrandTotal'],0,',','.') ?></h3><input type="hidden" name="QuoteHash" value="<?= hash('sha256',json_encode($quote)) ?>"><button class="btn btn-success" name="action" value="create"><?= !empty($editId)?'Simpan Revisi Invoice':'Create Invoice' ?></button><?php endif; ?></form></div></div></section></div>
